#: source/how-to/multi_asset_spawning.rst:4
msgid "Spawning Multiple Assets"
msgstr "生成多个资产"

#: source/how-to/multi_asset_spawning.rst:8
msgid ""
"Typical spawning configurations (introduced in the :ref:`tutorial-spawn-"
"prims` tutorial) copy one asset across all prim paths resolved from an "
"expression. Multi-asset workflows cover two related composition needs:"
msgstr ""
"典型的生成配置（见 :ref:`tutorial-spawn-prims` 教程）会将同一个资产复制到表达式解析出的所有 prim "
"路径。多资产工作流满足两种相关的组合需求："

#: source/how-to/multi_asset_spawning.rst:11
msgid ""
"A rigid object collection batches several rigid objects in every environment"
" behind one data and command API."
msgstr "刚性物体集合将每个环境中的多个刚性物体批量组织起来，通过统一的数据和命令 API 访问。"

#: source/how-to/multi_asset_spawning.rst:12
msgid ""
"A multi-asset spawner declares several variants for one scene asset binding,"
" allowing environments to contain different geometry or robot variants."
msgstr "多资产生成器为一个场景资产绑定声明多个变体，使不同环境可包含不同几何体或机器人变体。"

#: source/how-to/multi_asset_spawning.rst:15
msgid ""
"This guide demonstrates both mechanisms and explains how their execution "
"differs between PhysX and Newton."
msgstr "本指南演示这两种机制，并解释它们在 PhysX 和 Newton 中的执行差异。"

#: source/how-to/multi_asset_spawning.rst:17
msgid ""
"The packaged ``multi-asset`` example provides the reference script, "
"``multi_asset.py``."
msgstr "打包提供的 ``multi-asset`` 示例包含参考脚本 ``multi_asset.py`` 。"

#: source/how-to/multi_asset_spawning.rst:0
msgid "Code for multi_asset.py"
msgstr "multi_asset.py 的代码"

#: source/how-to/multi_asset_spawning.rst:26
msgid ""
"With the default Newton configuration, this script creates multiple "
"environments containing:"
msgstr "使用默认 Newton 配置时，此脚本会创建多个环境，其中包含："

#: source/how-to/multi_asset_spawning.rst:28
msgid "a rigid object collection containing a sphere, a cube, and a cylinder"
msgstr "由球体、立方体和圆柱体组成的刚性物体集合"

#: source/how-to/multi_asset_spawning.rst:29
msgid ""
"a rigid object selected from nine geometry and material variants by the "
"clone plan"
msgstr "由克隆计划从九种几何和材料变体中选择的刚性物体"

