#: source/how-to/multi_asset_spawning.rst:38
msgid "Rigid object collections"
msgstr "刚性物体集合"

#: source/how-to/multi_asset_spawning.rst:40
msgid ""
"Use a rigid object collection when every environment contains the same set "
"of independently moving rigid bodies and you want to access them as one "
"batch. The collection exposes data with an ``(env, object, ...)`` layout and"
" accepts ``(env_ids, obj_ids)`` selections for commands. Compared with "
"managing each object separately, the collection uses one batched physics "
"view."
msgstr ""
"如果每个环境都包含同一组独立运动的刚体，且希望以一个批次访问它们，可使用刚性物体集合。集合以 ``(env, object, ...)`` "
"布局提供数据，并接受 ``(env_ids, obj_ids)`` 选择来执行命令。与分别管理各物体相比，集合只使用一个批量物理视图。"

#: source/how-to/multi_asset_spawning.rst:51
msgid ""
"The :class:`~assets.RigidObjectCollectionCfg` configuration owns a "
"dictionary of :class:`~assets.RigidObjectCfg` instances. Each dictionary key"
" is the object's stable identifier within the collection."
msgstr ""
":class:`~assets.RigidObjectCollectionCfg` 配置持有一个由 "
":class:`~assets.RigidObjectCfg` 实例组成的字典。每个字典键都是对应物体在集合中的稳定标识。"

#: source/how-to/multi_asset_spawning.rst:54
msgid ""
"The example resets all collection members through the same API used by both "
"physics backends:"
msgstr "本例通过两个物理后端共用的 API 重置集合中的所有成员："

#: source/how-to/multi_asset_spawning.rst:64
msgid "Spawning variants for one scene asset"
msgstr "为一个场景资产生成不同变体"

#: source/how-to/multi_asset_spawning.rst:66
msgid ""
"Use :class:`~sim.spawners.wrappers.MultiAssetSpawnerCfg` and "
":class:`~sim.spawners.wrappers.MultiUsdFileCfg` to declare the available "
"variants for one scene asset binding. :class:`~scene.InteractiveScene` "
"includes these variants in its clone plan and assigns one valid prototype "
"combination to each environment."
msgstr ""
"使用 :class:`~sim.spawners.wrappers.MultiAssetSpawnerCfg` 和 "
":class:`~sim.spawners.wrappers.MultiUsdFileCfg` ，为一个场景资产绑定声明可用变体。 "
":class:`~scene.InteractiveScene` 将这些变体纳入克隆计划，并为每个环境分配一个有效的原型组合。"

#: source/how-to/multi_asset_spawning.rst:70
msgid ""
"For configuration-based assets, assign "
":class:`~sim.spawners.wrappers.MultiAssetSpawnerCfg` to the "
":class:`~assets.RigidObjectCfg` spawn configuration:"
msgstr ""
"对于通过配置构建的资产，将 :class:`~sim.spawners.wrappers.MultiAssetSpawnerCfg` 赋给 "
":class:`~assets.RigidObjectCfg` 的生成配置："

#: source/how-to/multi_asset_spawning.rst:79
msgid ""
"The ``assets_cfg`` list defines the prototypes available to the clone plan. "
"Variant assignment is controlled by :attr:`~cloner.CloneCfg.clone_strategy`;"
" the default :func:`~cloner.sequential` strategy assigns combinations in "
"round-robin order. To sample combinations randomly instead, set the strategy"
" before constructing the scene:"
msgstr ""
"``assets_cfg`` 列表定义克隆计划可用的原型。变体分配由 :attr:`~cloner.CloneCfg.clone_strategy` "
"控制；默认的 :func:`~cloner.sequential` 策略按轮转顺序分配组合。如果希望随机采样组合，应在构建场景前设置策略："

#: source/how-to/multi_asset_spawning.rst:89
msgid ""
"For USD assets, assign :class:`~sim.spawners.wrappers.MultiUsdFileCfg` to "
"the :class:`~assets.ArticulationCfg` spawn configuration:"
msgstr ""
"对于 USD 资产，将 :class:`~sim.spawners.wrappers.MultiUsdFileCfg` 赋给 "
":class:`~assets.ArticulationCfg` 的生成配置："

#: source/how-to/multi_asset_spawning.rst:99
msgid "Variant compatibility"
msgstr "变体兼容性"

#: source/how-to/multi_asset_spawning.rst:101
msgid ""
"All variants behind one batched asset interface must have a compatible "
"structure. Articulation variants must have the same links, joints, "
"collision-body count, and names. Rigid object variants can differ in "
"geometry and material while retaining a compatible rigid-body layout. Model "
"structurally different assets as separate scene bindings."
msgstr ""
"同一批量资产接口下的所有变体必须结构兼容。关节体变体必须具有相同的连杆、关节、碰撞刚体数量及名称。刚性物体变体可以有不同的几何和材料，但必须保留兼容的刚体布局。结构不同的资产应建模为独立的场景绑定。"

#: source/how-to/multi_asset_spawning.rst:106
msgid "Clone planning and physics replication"
msgstr "克隆规划与物理复制"

#: source/how-to/multi_asset_spawning.rst:108
msgid ""
":class:`~scene.InteractiveScene` represents multi-asset variants as clone-"
"plan prototypes. It can therefore keep "
":attr:`~scene.InteractiveSceneCfg.replicate_physics` enabled and replicate "
"each prototype only to its assigned environments. Do not disable physics "
"replication merely because a scene uses a multi-asset spawner. Reserve "
"``replicate_physics=False`` for per-environment stage differences that "
"cannot be represented as clone variants; that mode is not supported by the "
"Newton backend."
msgstr ""
":class:`~scene.InteractiveScene` 将多资产变体表示为克隆计划中的原型，因此可以保持 "
":attr:`~scene.InteractiveSceneCfg.replicate_physics` "
"开启，只向各原型所分配的环境复制该原型。不要仅因为场景使用多资产生成器，就禁用物理复制。只有无法表示为克隆变体的逐环境舞台差异，才使用 "
"``replicate_physics=False`` ；Newton 后端不支持该模式。"

#: source/how-to/multi_asset_spawning.rst:114
msgid ""
"The example keeps physics replication enabled. For Newton, it also narrows "
"the standalone object and articulation to one variant because their batched "
"Newton views currently require a uniform body layout across worlds:"
msgstr ""
"本例保持物理复制开启。对于 Newton，还会将独立物体和关节体分别缩减为一个变体，因为它们的批量 Newton 视图目前要求各世界的刚体布局一致："

#: source/how-to/multi_asset_spawning.rst:123
msgid ""
"For more detail on prototype assignment and replication, see :doc:`cloning`."
msgstr "原型分配与复制的更多细节见 :doc:`cloning` 。"

