#: source/how-to/multi_asset_spawning.rst:153
msgid ""
"The Newton commands exercise the same "
":class:`~assets.RigidObjectCollectionCfg` and ``(env_ids, obj_ids)`` APIs as"
" the PhysX command. They do not demonstrate per-environment object or "
"articulation variants because of the uniform-layout restriction described "
"above; use the PhysX command to inspect that part of the example. See the "
":doc:`installation guide </source/setup/installation/index>` before running "
"the kitless command."
msgstr ""
"Newton 命令使用与 PhysX 命令相同的 :class:`~assets.RigidObjectCollectionCfg` 和 "
"``(env_ids, obj_ids)`` API。由于上述布局一致性限制，它们不会演示不同环境的物体或关节体变体；要查看示例的这一部分，请使用 "
"PhysX 命令。运行不依赖 Kit 的命令前，参阅 :doc:`安装指南 </source/setup/installation/index>` 。"

